# zsh/aliases/gitrc
#
# Git aliases and interactive pickers: status/diff/commit shortcuts, fzf
# staging (gaf), interactive branch switching (gsws), log browsing (gl),
# dangling commits (gfc), stashes (gstl), worktrees (gwa/gwc/gwr), WIP
# commit helpers (gwip/gunwip) and GitHub repo/PR creation
# (ghre/ghren/ghpr).
#
# Interactive functions check that the shell is inside a work tree before
# doing anything, and hand control to fzf/less with the repository colors
# enabled.
#
# Sourced by conf.d/aliases.zsh after the plugins.
#
# See: conf.d/aliases.zsh (source order)
# See: aliases/aliasrc (general-purpose set)
# See: conf.d/git-widgets.zsh (fzf pickers bound to Ctrl+G chords)
# See: functions/wvim (jump to the definition of any entry here)

